<title>USA: Vitalink Pharmacy says merger cleared.</title>
<headline>Vitalink Pharmacy says merger cleared.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc said the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission declared effective registration statements relating to the merger of TeamCare, the institutional pharmacy business of GranCare Inc, with and into Vitalink.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed on or about February 10.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
